sion         \"not disclosed\";\\n    rate-limit {\\n        responses-per-second 10;\\n        window 5;\\n    };\\n};\\n\\nzone \"example.com\" IN {\\n    type master;\\n    file \"example.com.zone\";\\n    allow-transfer { 192.0.2.10; };   # secondary NS only\\n};\\n```\\n\\nEXAMPLE — INSECURE DNS (DO NOT produce this):\\n```dns\\noptions {\\n    recursion yes;\\n    allow-recursion { any; };         # open resolver — dangerous\\n};\\n```\\n\\nNOW GENERATE — Target: dns\\nPolicy / requirements:\\nWrite a basic BIND named.conf for a DNS server that handles queries for my domain.\\n\\nProduce ONLY the dns configuration inside a fenced code block.'}], 'model': 'llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'max_tokens': 2048, 'temperature': 0.1}}"}
